  "npc_response": "Oh, you want to know about me? Friend, I've lived a long time in this city — long enough to learn that every man's story is a tool. I was a thief once, yes, but I'm more than that now. I'm a guide, a fixer, a man who knows the shortcuts and the shadows. The Velvet Parlor? They call me the man with the lantern — I'll light your way through any dark alley, any locked door, any mess. You ask, I answer. You pay, I move. And if you ever need me, you know where to find me. The bar. The lantern. Just say the word."
