  "npc_response": "You ask me for direction, and I can only give you what I have to give. Stay in the garden's light, keep your hands empty, and do not go to Lindqvist Yard alone. If you must travel, take the road by the river, where the night is kinder. And whatever you carry, do not let it out here. The chapel is not far, and I will be there if you need me. But I cannot promise more than that."
