  "narration": "Vorn the Mad's eyes snap wide, pupils dilating as if the very air has thickened. He staggers back half a step, one hand flying to his chest where a silver locket glints beneath his ragged robes. The ravens in the dead tree tilt their heads, one cawing softly. He does not look at the player directly, but his voice drops to a conspiratorial whisper that somehow carries further than shouting.",
