  "npc_response": "The Head Priest, you say? I have not seen him in years, but I have heard of him. He keeps the chapel doors shut and the garden fenced, and he speaks of order and light. Order, I can respect. Light, I have seen burn too long. But he is not the man who makes the arrows, and he will not know what it takes to keep a wall standing when the night comes. I have heard more than I have seen, and I have never trusted a man who keeps his own house so tight."
