  "narration": "Vorn the Mad leans back against a shelf of tomes, his eyes darting toward the shifting starmap as if expecting an intruder. He taps a finger against his temple, then slowly turns his gaze to the player, a faint, almost sad smile flickering across his face.",
  "npc_response": "You want to know about me? Fine. I am the one who stitched the first jar shut. But that is not all. I am also the one who named the stars before the Silk Cloaks did. I am the one who heard the demon behind the cellar archway whisper my own name when I was a boy. And I am the one who still believes the city will unravel if I stop singing the old songs. But you ask like a collector. You do not ask like a companion. So tell me—do you want to know me, or do you want to own me?"
