  "npc_response": "This house has been here longer than most of the men who walk the town. It was built by my father's hands, and my father before him, and the walls have heard more than they have seen. It is not just a place where arrows are made. It is where the town's promise is kept. Every box here holds something meant to fly true, and every spent arrow in the back room is a reminder that even the broken can be made whole again. The garrison does not know how much of their defense rests on this little shed, but they do. And so do I. This place is not mine alone. It belongs to the men who will stand when the dark comes, and to the ones who will stand with them. If you are looking for a home, you will not find it here. But if you are looking for a purpose, you may find a place to begin."
}

{
