  "npc_response": "This tomb was built not for the dead, but for the living who would forget. Every empress and emperor who ever ruled this land is laid here, their jewels and treasures left as offerings to time. But I have made this place my prison, my study, my throne. Here, I watch over the dead so that the living may not repeat their mistakes. The walls remember every crown that was taken, every name that was erased. And when you walk among them, you walk in their shadow. Do not mistake this for a resting place. It is a warning."
}

{
