  ],
  "memory_summary": "Garrow the Cartographer responds to the player's request to learn more about the courtyard, describing its history and his own past here.",
  "new_entities": [],
  "rule_flags": [],
  "narration": "Garrow leans back against the mossy stone wall, his eyes tracing the tangled vines overhead. He speaks slowly, as if the words have weight.",
  "npc_response": "This courtyard was once a supply depot, I think. Before the overgrowth, there were carts here, and men who kept the roads in order. Now the vines have swallowed the paths, and the only thing left is the map I used to keep. I marked this place as a waypoint once, back when I still trusted the roads. I suppose I should have known better. Places like this don't stay quiet for long. They just wait, and then they remember you."
}

{
  "world_updates": [
    {
      "type": "NPC_SPOKE"
    }
  ],
  "memory_summary": "Garrow the Cartographer speaks at length about the overgrown courtyard and the lingering presence of the Foundry.",
  "new_entities": [],
  "rule_flags": [],
  "narration": "Garrow leans back against a moss-covered stone bench, his eyes drifting toward the rusted bell tower in the distance. A slow, tired smile touches his lips as he speaks.",
  "npc_response": "This place... it's been here longer than any of us. The water came up first, then the foundry fell, and what's left is what the rain and the weeds decided to keep. The courtyard's overgrown because nothing's been tended to in years — not by anyone who wanted to be seen. The bell tower still rings, though. Every storm, I think. Like it's counting the days since the foundry closed. Some say it's a warning. Others say it's just a bell that hasn't found a new purpose. I don't know which is true. But if you listen close, you can hear the foundry in the stones. It's in the way the water pools where the old machinery once stood. It's in the silence between the bell and the rain. This place isn't empty. It's holding its breath.",
  "npc_response": ""
}

{
  "world_updates": [
    {
      "type": "NPC_SPOKE"
    }
  ],
  "memory_summary": "Ivo the Tinker answers the player's question about strange occurrences at the Sunken Stable.",
