  "narration": "Ivo leans back against a rusted gear, his hands resting on a belt of worn tools. His eyes narrow slightly as he speaks, and for a moment he seems to be listening to the low hum of the machinery around him.",
  "npc_response": "Strange? I've seen plenty of strange things in this foundry. But lately... the gears hum when they shouldn't. The oil runs thick and black, like it's been stirred by something that isn't water. And the Stable's silence has a weight to it. I don't know what's waiting down there. I only know I've stopped trusting the quiet."
