  "npc_response": "There are always those who need help, if you know where to look. The road brings them here—lost, or carrying something they cannot name. I have seen a cartographer's apprentice vanish near the Foundry, and a sailor who came back with nothing but a coin and a warning. But I do not know who needs help now. I only know the quiet places are where they gather, and they do not say much. If you want to find them, follow the road, not the map. The map will tell you where to go. The road will tell you who is waiting."
